 1. NoMethodError              nil.length
    undefined method 'length' for nil
 2. NoMethodError              Vault.new.secret
    private method 'secret' called for an instance of Vault
 3. NoMethodError              "s".zzz
    undefined method 'zzz' for an instance of String
 4. NameError                  nope
    undefined local variable or method 'nope' for main
 5. NameError                  Nope
    uninitialized constant Nope
 6. ArgumentError              two(1)
    wrong number of arguments (given 1, expected 2)
 7. ArgumentError              kw
    missing keyword: :k
 8. ArgumentError              kw2(z: 1)
    unknown keyword: :z
 9. ArgumentError              [3, nil].sort
    comparison of Integer with nil failed
10. TypeError                  "a" + 1
    no implicit conversion of Integer into String
11. TypeError                  1 + "a"
    String can't be coerced into Integer
12. ZeroDivisionError          1 / 0
    divided by 0
13. KeyError                   {a: 1}.fetch(:x)
    key not found: :x
14. IndexError                 [1, 2, 3].fetch(5)
    index 5 outside of array bounds: -3...3
15. FrozenError                "abc".freeze << "d"
    can't modify frozen String: "abc"
16. StopIteration              [].each.next
    iteration reached an end
17. LocalJumpError             needs_block  (def needs_block = yield)
    no block given (yield)
18. SystemStackError           down  (def down = down)
    stack level too deep
19. NoMatchingPatternError     case 5; in String then 1; end
    5: String === 5 does not return true
20. NoMatchingPatternKeyError  case {a: 1}; in {name:} then 1; end
    {a: 1}: key not found: :name
21. FloatDomainError           Float::NAN.to_i
    NaN
22. FloatDomainError           Float::INFINITY.to_i
    Infinity
23. LoadError                  require "nope_nothing"
    cannot load such file -- nope_nothing
24. Errno::ENOENT              File.read("missing.txt")
    No such file or directory @ rb_sysopen - missing.txt
25. IOError                    f.close; f.read
    closed stream
26. EOFError                   f.readline at end of file
    end of file reached
27. UncaughtThrowError         throw :x
    uncaught throw :x
28. NotImplementedError        raise NotImplementedError
    NotImplementedError
29. SyntaxError                RubyVM::InstructionSequence.compile("def")
    (message not printed: it quotes the source, with carets)
